Sunday Funday this week was the Main Street Half Marathon in Clinton &amp; Flemington NJ. 2nd overall in 1:18:27  https://t.co/J55EGnurmf https://t.co/KsdfP6y5xH

Course was a tad short though. So not actually a 1:18 Half 😞. Was still a great tune up for the Philly marathon next month https://t.co/AHayUSnUpP

@zedbanana8 No sir. But I am doing Philly next month !!

@EricBalchunas Thank you !! Gonna try to go through the half in Philly not too too much slower than this and see if I can hang on. Hahaha. Will either go great or absolutely horribly. Very little room for middle ground lol.

@adavidov19 Ha. Thank you Alexandra!

@CodyCarboneDC Represent !! How often do you actually make it back to your old stomping grounds these days? lol

@nonefungible A lot lower than I wanted it to be for marathon training tbh. Tweaked/pulled my hamstring on Labor Day so really messed up my training but this week was my highest in a long time and I didn’t crack 60. https://t.co/YtaeXzawkw

@nonefungible 🫡

@JimmyKostro Is this like a virtual half ?

@christophercamp Good callout. lol Was almost mediocre in D3 but I ran for all 4 years lol. But this is one of a couple stints back to actually training since ~2014

@mikealfred Thanks Mike! Impressive sir. Technically still better than me because unfortunately this doesn’t count. Wasn’t a full half but it’s okay. The real goal is the Philly full next month.

@GunnersAlive Nothing was gonna make this the right length absent like zig zagging every road lol. A turn around in the first few miles just wasn’t far enough out. 🤷🏼‍♂️ Every other race is pretty much always long on the gps if it’s the right distance.

